{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405","id":"pg_0b64e261965b5a428d67178433db0d89","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/agentsmesh-agentsmesh-agents-md-1f90b14194d0-178433db0d89.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_349e42cd7c975fa989ed6084f241380e"],"title":"AgentsMesh/AgentsMesh/AGENTS.md @ 1f90b14194d0","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0d106f000c296b554e29110ea7382c6b5d7bb5bc5e00d2b915d588278142bde6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The runner CLI exposes login (with --headless and --server options), run, and service install/start subcommands."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2bc41b0538b7a6939c35d3dbd5362414a141ee6c9e27f65af498680de8231727"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Client side includes a Rust core of 10 crates compiled to WASM for web/desktop and exposed to iOS via UniFFI, plus Next.js web, Electron desktop, SwiftUI/TCA iOS, and a web-admin console."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3073488140587ba1b71883fa442aec6c133706190547b3711df2c24474d3665f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Pods communicate over channels with @mentions within a bound mesh topology, and tickets on a Kanban board can be bound to pods with progress and MR/PR tracking."},{"claim_ids":["clm_544297cb7fd13bf91d01e3b1292e917184328be5a05b2c4de84c8fc6e2bbf06d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Runners advertise capacity (max_concurrent_pods) and pods are scheduled onto a chosen runner or an available one from the pool; each pod gets an isolated Git worktree sandbox, private credentials, and its own branch."},{"claim_ids":["clm_998a48c72462952db8470c2aa4302aa850458369df5533595b1fcb1adacd86af"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The architecture splits control plane from data plane: orchestration travels over gRPC with mTLS while terminal I/O streams through a stateless Relay cluster, so the backend never handles PTY bytes."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a5a3ccb0fec004a5312a032d70a8370e130b81a2f0f4c8a523f1b52b7bae37d3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"An Autopilot control agent watches a pod, sends the next instruction when it goes idle, enforces iteration caps, keeps decision history, and supports human takeover and handback."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a97aef40fa55433c2789ee1dde5d931170bf0e3dcb9d6210bf1998323132ab07"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The code is licensed under BSL-1.1: non-production use, copying and modification are allowed, but production use requires a commercial license until the 2030-02-28 change date, after which it becomes GPL-2.0-or-later."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cf2a54ee6f4230ba40aa9f35c9c1979e36c325585884fee5ded7b00276fe16f6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The stack uses PostgreSQL and Redis, MinIO for S3-compatible storage, Traefik as reverse proxy, JWT for web auth and mTLS for runner connections."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e207fcc2a48dcd22c6f07ea244a08c1a60ce2d472de05dc95c581712d7856e99"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Any terminal-based agent can run; built-in support is documented for Claude Code, Codex CLI, Gemini CLI, Aider, and OpenCode."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ea545419cf54b28aff3267fb6248324edbe84867533bc99c44bde783790620b3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Server side comprises a Go backend (Gin+GORM) handling auth, pod lifecycle, tickets, billing and runner-cert PKI; a WebSocket Relay for terminal data; and a self-hosted Go runner daemon that spawns PTY pods."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0d106f000c296b554e29110ea7382c6b5d7bb5bc5e00d2b915d588278142bde6","clm_2bc41b0538b7a6939c35d3dbd5362414a141ee6c9e27f65af498680de8231727","clm_3073488140587ba1b71883fa442aec6c133706190547b3711df2c24474d3665f","clm_544297cb7fd13bf91d01e3b1292e917184328be5a05b2c4de84c8fc6e2bbf06d","clm_998a48c72462952db8470c2aa4302aa850458369df5533595b1fcb1adacd86af","clm_a5a3ccb0fec004a5312a032d70a8370e130b81a2f0f4c8a523f1b52b7bae37d3","clm_a97aef40fa55433c2789ee1dde5d931170bf0e3dcb9d6210bf1998323132ab07","clm_cf2a54ee6f4230ba40aa9f35c9c1979e36c325585884fee5ded7b00276fe16f6","clm_e207fcc2a48dcd22c6f07ea244a08c1a60ce2d472de05dc95c581712d7856e99","clm_ea545419cf54b28aff3267fb6248324edbe84867533bc99c44bde783790620b3"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405","id":"pg_0eb7a22080ab59a99832212391f40181","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/agentsmesh-agentsmesh-readme-md-1f90b14194d0-212391f40181.md","record_ty